==Indonesian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|id|liat||colloquial}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|id|ms|lihat}}, from {{inh|id|poz-mly-pro|*lihat}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|id|/ˈli.hat̚/}}
* {{rhymes|id|hat̚|at̚|t̚|s=2}}
* {{hyph|id|li|hat}}

===Verb===
{{head|id|verb|active|melihat|passive|dilihat}}

# {{lb|id|transitive}} to [[see]]
## to [[perceive]] or [[detect]] someone or something with the [[eyes]], or as if by [[sight]]
##: {{ux|id|Aku '''melihat''' seekor kucing tidur di sana.|I '''saw''' a cat sleeping there.}}
## to [[witness]] or [[observe]] by personal experience
## to make a [[call upon]]; to [[visit]]
##: {{ux|id|Aku mau pergi untuk '''melihat''' kawanku.|I want to go to '''see''' my friend.}}
## to [[ensure]] that something happens, especially by personally witnessing it
##: {{ux|id|Aku '''lihat''' dia baik-baik saja di minggu kemarin.|I '''saw''' he was fine last week.}}
## to [[determine]] by [[trial]] or [[experiment]]; to [[find out]]
##: {{ux|id|Kita '''lihat''' saja nanti siapa pemenangnya.|We will '''see''' later who the winner is.}}
## to [[examine]] something closely, or to utilize something, often as a temporary alternative
##: {{ux|id|Bolehkah aku '''melihat''' telepon barumu?|Can I '''see''' your new phone?}}
## {{lb|id|used in the imperative}} to [[reference]] or to [[study]] for further [[details]]
##: {{ux|id|'''Lihat''' halaman ini untuk petunjuk lebih lanjut.|'''See''' this page for further instructions.}}
# {{lb|id|transitive|colloquial}} to [[look]] {{gl|to [[try]] to [[see]], to [[pay attention]] to with one’s [[eyes]]}}
#: {{syn|id|pandangi}}
# {{lb|id|transitive|colloquial}} to [[stare]] {{gl|to look [[fixedly]]}}
#: {{syn|id|tatap}}

